<p style="margin: 10px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style="font-size: 8pt; color: 666666; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;">感谢您有意加入英特尔<sup>&reg;</sup> Cloud Insider 计划。</span></p><!-- <p style="margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;"><font style="font-size:8pt;color:666666;font-family:arial, sans-serif;">Thank you for your interest in the Intel Technology Provider Program. </font></p>--><br />
<p style="margin: 10px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style="font-size: 8pt; color: 666666; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;">顺祝商祺！<br />英特尔<sup>&reg;</sup> Cloud Insider 计划管理员。<br />您的解决方案。我们的技术。共同打造更加智能的世界。</span></p>
